<!--
  Notification status-bar small icon (monochrome).

  Android renders the notification small icon as a mask: only the alpha channel
  is used and the system tints it. This dumbbell glyph is drawn in solid white
  so it displays correctly across all system themes. It must live in `drawable`
  (flutter_local_notifications resolves the small icon as @drawable/<name>),
  which is why the previous `ic_launcher` (a mipmap) silently failed.
-->
